      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I meant any instance of the world, and it is confirmed if you look at the image that it isn't possible to vote kick the creator of the world and the VRChat Team chose to do it like that, if you disagree to all this then please make a new post in the future request category.\n\"Same as how creators don't get the right to barge into any private instance.\" - that is because of privacy, not getting vote kicked from any instance as the creator of the world has nothing to do with privacy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
