      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am fully with @{5b348634f5643c23501638a1|full_name} on this.\n\nJust because you are the world creator/uploader/author, doesn't mean you are above the rules. Not all world creators are saints, and some times the majority of people will not want them there.\n\nWe really need some better thoughts on why world creators have moderation powers over all instance of their world, even in private instances. See: [remove-world-creator-moderation-powers](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/remove-world-creator-moderation-powers)",
