      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name} I sincerely believe this is the wrong point of view, you shouldn't feel that as a vrchat user you are entitled to use anyone else's work. At the very least? You should be thankful.\n\nIt sounds like you have some sort of personal beef with that creator and really, really should be voting with your feet and not use their work.",
